      Data: 100|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Run used to get under the catch point. Round 2 sprinted at 10 m/s with
        a 25 m/s2 start, which read as a teleport (PCVR 3); round 4 came back down
        to 8. Round 5 (PCVR 2026-09-22, '\u3082\u3063\u3068\u9060\u304F\u304B\u3089\u8DF3\u3093\u3067\u3044\u3044
        - \u8DF3\u3070\u305A\u306B\u8FF7\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u611F\u3058\u304C\u591A\u3044'):
        9.5 m/s. The shape the user objected to was the SNAP TURN and the standing
        start, not the speed, and every metre per second here buys jump candidates
        the dog can actually reach. The run clip is sped up in proportion above runSpeed
        (capped by maxRunAnimScale)"
