    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Speed cap of the B chase (catching up from behind) only; A / C keep
        chaseRunSpeed. Real dogs sprint 8-11 m/s (Lab / Shiba / Samoyed) and less
        for the short-legged ones, so +10% over the PCVR-approved 9.5: 11 for the
        medium / large breeds, 10.5 for Corgi / Dachs / Pome (user 2026-09-26)'
