      Data: 143|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Grace at the start of Ready: for this long the dog stays where it is
        instead of running off to the stand-off spot, so the player who just took
        the disc out of its mouth can say \u3088\u3057\u3088\u3057 first. Round 5
        (PCVR 2026-09-22): 4 -> 2 s. The pet-then-step-back-then-throw flow was '\u3081\u3061\u3083\u304F\u3061\u3083\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3044\u3044'
        but the wait afterwards was too long; petting itself still holds the dog
        for as long as it lasts"
